  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1347827.svg\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-萊姆色?style=plastic&amp;link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-紅色?style=plastic&amp;link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組根據<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>（<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Generators</a>）新增了自訂的<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>分類，讓新手玩家無需查閱外部文件就能學習更多知識。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/MekaGenJei/screen/bio.png?raw=true\" width=\"752\" height=\"453\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/MekaGenJei/screen/pump.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"642\" height=\"458\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
